    </p>

    <section id="article-1">
      <h2>Article 1. PREAMBLE</h2>
      <p>IZIKA, registered with the Montpellier Trade and Companies Register under number
        807 746 524, whose registered office is at 199 rue Hélène Boucher, 34170 Castelnau-le-Lez,
        France, is an IT services company.</p>
      <p>It develops and markets the IZIKA offering, software dedicated to the automatic
        calculation of business road trips and of the resulting <strong>mileage
          allowances</strong>. The IZIKA software notably allows:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>connecting online calendars such as, without limitation: Google Calendar, iCloud
          Calendar, Outlook Calendar, various calendars in ICS file format, and appointment lists
          in CSV format, so that a copy of the appointments of the connected calendar(s) can be
          imported into the IZIKA software.
        </li>
        <li>from these imported appointments, obtaining an automatic calculation of the distances
          travelled from a starting point (for example: the user's office) to an appointment
          location and back to the starting point. Users can also configure round trips (no
          return to the starting point between two appointments).
        </li>
        <li>based on the distances computed by its mapping providers, IZIKA provides an estimate
          of the mileage allowance amount.
        </li>
        <li>the computed distances and the resulting mileage allowances are provided for
          information purposes and under the responsibility of the user, who must imperatively
          verify that the computed distances and the mileage allowance amounts contain no errors.
        </li>
      </ol>
      <p>THE CUSTOMER acknowledges having been fully informed of the list of services and
        applications provided by IZIKA that may be made available to them under this contract.
        These terms and conditions define the conditions for subscribing to and using IZIKA.</p>
      <p>Any person using the services offered by IZIKA is irrebuttably presumed to have read and
        accepted these terms and conditions.</p>
    </section>

