      <p>IZIKA is software for the automatic calculation of business road trips and of the
        resulting mileage allowances. It is accessible from all types of mobile and desktop
        devices running Linux, Android, Mac or Windows. IZIKA is offered in hosted mode (SAAS).
        The CUSTOMER has secure access on the Web via a dedicated URL communicated when
        subscribing to the contract. The CUSTOMER has the non-exclusive right to use the services
        offered by IZIKA under the conditions set out in the GENERAL CONDITIONS and the SPECIAL
        CONDITIONS they have signed. IZIKA handles data hosting, maintenance and software
        security. The backup of the data used by the CUSTOMER is performed under the conditions
        defined in the SPECIAL CONDITIONS. The exhaustive list of application Services is defined
        in the special conditions. The features, type and number of application Services may
        evolve over time and it will be up to the CUSTOMER, where applicable, to learn these new
        features or changes, with the help of the dedicated documents made available by IZIKA and
        through training sessions offered by IZIKA.</p>
    </section>

