      <p>The CONTRACT and all related contractual documents are governed by French law, to the
        exclusion of any other legislation. Disputes or litigation arising from the performance
        of the CONTRACT or its appendices must, before any judicial proceedings, be the subject
        of an attempt at amicable settlement. To this end, the parties agree to meet within 30
